GET {{baseUrl}}/anything/vars

::: query
user = {{username}}

::: pre
env.set("username", "overridden");

::: post
test("a session override beats the environment", () => {
  expect(res.json().args.user).toBe("overridden");
});

::: docs
Overrides `username` for the session. `session-unset` removes the override again.
